~ start
After the Umugites are slain, you find the captive in one of the rooms, still in a dusky, glittering robe, though disheveled and almost mindless with shock. At the sight of the woman, his gaze becomes clearer.
"Ah, my clear and oily Unut!" he cries. "To quote the ancient texts, bene omnia que bene finitur!"

After the reunion is done, the woman approaches you.
"The Umugites may have taken his treasure, but my... colleague is indubitably alive. Know that you have done a service for the Astromancers -- nay, for knowledge itself, and, when time is right, our knowledge shall serve you."
do GameInfo.playerAlliances.append("Astromancers")

=> END